WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.220 --> 00:00:09.544
<v Audio Description>Visual scene one: Card one glows amber while a 3D cyan curve climbs to a flat emerald finish-line shelf where extra compute bars turn rose as waste.

2
00:00:09.884 --> 00:00:15.678
<v Presenter>First, every job has a finish line, and extra computer work after that point is waste.

3
00:00:16.018 --> 00:00:25.934
<v Audio Description>Visual scene two: Card two shines cyan as dozens of new amber task pillars sprout across the 3D floor, lifting total demand even as each task finishes cleanly.

4
00:00:26.274 --> 00:00:32.334
<v Presenter>Second, cheaper computer work makes people start many more jobs, so total use can keep rising.

5
00:00:32.674 --> 00:00:40.483
<v Audio Description>Visual scene three: Card three locks in emerald above a glowing amber joule floor bar showing physical electricity never drops to zero.

6
00:00:40.823 --> 00:00:46.912
<v Presenter>Third, money prices for AI are falling fast, but the electricity it burns is never free.
